# MedSync Health, Inc.
# PTO Accrual Schedule

## Standard Employees

- **Years 0-2:** 20 days per year (1.67 days per month)
- **Years 3-5:** 22 days per year (1.83 days per month)
- **Years 6+:** 25 days per year (2.08 days per month)

## Directors and Above

- **All Tenure:** 25 days per year (2.08 days per month)

## Notes

- PTO accrues monthly and can be used as it is accrued.
- Unused PTO does not roll over to the next year.
- PTO payout upon termination is subject to state law.
